const useStyles = makeStyles((theme) => ({
    root: {
        padding: theme.spacing(2),
    },
}));
```

**Why avoid**: Deprecated, v7 doesn't support it well

### ❌ styled() Components

```typescript
// ❌ AVOID - styled-components pattern
