const StyledBox = styled(Box)(({ theme }) => ({
    padding: theme.spacing(2),
}));
```

**Why avoid**: sx prop is more flexible and doesn't create new components

### ✅ Use sx Prop Instead

```typescript
// ✅ PREFERRED
